{"id":"17bdb224f449da45","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-reflection.md","title":"纤维反射","display":"df-fibred-reflection — 纤维反射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-reflection","display":"df-fibred-reflection — 纤维反射","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"§1.8, fibred adjunctions and reflections; Definition 11.6.1, p. 694 (PDF 714)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-fibred-reflection"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-reflection"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-reflection — 纤维反射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.8, fibred adjunctions and reflections; Definition 11.6.1, p. 694 (PDF 714)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-reflection</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow XL\">\\(\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow XL\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:LX\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\epsilon:LX\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 是垂直自然变换，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredReflection}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredReflection}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(L;p,q)\\land\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(X;q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E)\\ \\epsilon_{LE}\\circ L\\eta_E=\\operatorname{id}_{LE}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\ X\\epsilon_D\\circ\\eta_{XD}=\\operatorname{id}_{XD}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(\\epsilon_D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(L;p,q)\\land\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(X;q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E)\\ \\epsilon_{LE}\\circ L\\eta_E=\\operatorname{id}_{LE}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\ X\\epsilon_D\\circ\\eta_{XD}=\\operatorname{id}_{XD}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(\\epsilon_D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>前两条三角律描述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\dashv X\">\\(L\\dashv X\\)</span>，余单位可逆描述右伴随满忠实；每个基对象上限制得到反射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_I\\dashv X_I\">\\(L_I\\dashv X_I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>单位、余单位的垂直性在假设中明确给出。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§1.8, fibred adjunctions and reflections; Definition 11.6.1, p. 694 (PDF 714)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$、$X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$；$\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow XL$、$\\epsilon:LX\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}$ 是垂直自然变换，采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\Rightarrow XL","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon:LX\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredReflection}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(L;p,q)\\land\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(X;q,p)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E)\\ \\epsilon_{LE}\\circ L\\eta_E=\\operatorname{id}_{LE}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\ X\\epsilon_D\\circ\\eta_{XD}=\\operatorname{id}_{XD}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D)\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(\\epsilon_D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L\\dashv X","display":false},{"tex":"L_I\\dashv X_I","display":false}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$，$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$，$X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$；$\\eta,\\epsilon$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-reflection]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-reflection|df-fibred-reflection — 纤维反射]]"},{"id":"97331c72a05275ec","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"新增理由：现有 [[16-df-fibred-reflection]] 只给抽象反射接口；本节点内建书中由四种和与单位构造该接口的具体项映射，供重建语法与范畴模型的下一步对应使用。它不是 J05 的整体可靠性或完备性证明。"}],"outgoing":["afc1fb30a05f3662","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}